# Swift build output. This was previously (accidentally) committed - see
# swift/.build/arm64-apple-macosx/release/libTinyBridgeVZBridge.dylib in git history - which
# is how a stale, non-compiling prebuilt dylib ended up checked into the repo giving false
# confidence that the Swift bridge built successfully. It's a real build artifact, not
# source; build it locally with `just vz-bridge` / `swift build --package-path swift/ -c
# release` instead of relying on a committed copy.
swift/.build/

